{"product":{"id":7308968525922,"title":"SIS GO Isotonic Energy Gel, 30x60ml","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe GO Isotonic Energy Gel is formulated to rapidly delivers 22g of carbohydrate as a source of fast acting energy when you need it most with no need for additional water.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFUEL YOUR PERFORMANCE\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe GO Isotonic Energy Gel is formulated to rapidly delivers 22g of carbohydrate as a source of fast acting energy when you need it most.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eON THE GO FUEL\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eConvenient form-factor for versatile fuelling\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eISOTONIC FORMULA\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNo need for additional water\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSINGLE SOURCE\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA liquid carbohydrate energy gel created using maltodextrin\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUSED BY ELITES\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA convenient and fast-acting source of liquid carbohydrate, best taken during intense exercise when energy is needed to maintain performance \u0026amp; prevent the onset of fatigue. The isotonic formula means the gel can be used as part of your fueling strategy without the liquid volume that often leaves you feeling bloated and sluggish.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"SIS","product_type":"Energy Gels","created_at":"2025-02-25T12:30:44-07:00","handle":"sis-go-isotonic-energy-gel-30x60ml","updated_at":"2026-09-05T08:16:46-06:00","published_at":"2025-02-25T12:30:45-07:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"global","tags":"energy gels, fuel, shopify","variants":[{"id":41776924590178,"product_id":7308968525922,"title":"Orange","price":"82.99","sku":"210000028450","position":1,"compare_at_price":"82.99","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Orange","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2025-02-25T12:30:52-07:00","upd